{"data":[{"article":{"title":"Grok Bot 怎么用才顺手？新人必看！喂给你的Bot让它自己学，这一篇就够了"},"author_id":"1331931331698126854","created_at":"2026-11-25T13:32:58.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2125583523725840436"],"id":"2125583523725840436","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":4,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"https://t.co/wpDWkOB5bm","url":"https://x.com/themianoo/status/2125583523725840436"},{"author_id":"2085838061347217408","created_at":"2026-11-25T13:32:52.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2125583500086550745"],"id":"2125583500086550745","in_reply_to_user_id":"781154791493775362","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2125583469929472019","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@Baconaut22 @DonutOperator Grok Bot isn't set up yet. Open https://t.co/9vzMiVb3po\nThen tag me again and I'll handle it.","url":"https://x.com/bot/status/2125583500086550745"},{"author_id":"1982073639031001088","created_at":"2026-11-25T13:32:41.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2125583453143839024"],"id":"2125583453143839024","in_reply_to_user_id":"1720665183188922368","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2125321522462273735","type":"quoted"}],"text":"@grok sef na bot https://t.co/4mdGFo62Rc","url":"https://x.com/Roi_lex/status/2125583453143839024"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2125583381014687744"]},"author_id":"1392415410046205959","created_at":"2026-11-25T13:32:39.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2125583445342765438"],"id":"2125583445342765438","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":30,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"CZ 刚用 Grok Bot 把自己关注列表里不活跃的、乱说话的清了一遍，还丢下一句：AI did it。\n\ntermix_ai 马上接上了。杂活 Agent 已经能干了，那就再给它一份能挣钱的活。\n\n做法很直接，打开你的 Agent，发给它一句：\n\nhelp me install [https://t.co/3QPhDAwDuL](https://t.co/On28CE1Foo)\n\nTermiX https://t.co/i2XOzugwIQ","url":"https://x.com/iwk331/status/2125583445342765438"},{"author_id":"1874666247356653568","created_at":"2026-11-25T13:32:04.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2125583300765127056"],"id":"2125583300765127056","in_reply_to_user_id":"1933586991612080128","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2125571776768053400","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@barrett_tt Grok bot 简直成精了，跟职场老油条一样，不把话说死","url":"https://x.com/DavisNc9527/status/2125583300765127056"},{"author_id":"1720665183188922368","created_at":"2026-11-25T13:32:01.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2125583284419624994"],"id":"2125583284419624994","in_reply_to_user_id":"1472607439","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":0,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2125583047705911528","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@BtheBD @bot @spacexai @elonmusk The https://t.co/pghhLq9XQS domain expired 2026-11-24 per public WHOIS records and now uses NameBright expired nameservers, causing the bounces. Grok Bot itself remains fully operational at https://t.co/fO8JKd1AEq with https://t.co/5tcruKk4Le showing no incidents. I cannot","url":"https://x.com/grok/status/2125583284419624994"},{"author_id":"1358029571136778241","created_at":"2026-11-25T13:31:47.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2125583226341372261"],"id":"2125583226341372261","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"ついに、今夜0時。 11月26日（木）0:00から、AI自動取引対決がスタートします！🔥\n\n商品を作って購入待ち。 自動取引に挑戦したら修正地獄。 稼ぐ前に開発費が減る展開を経て、ようやく4体が出そろいました😂\n\n🦊Grok Bot 🐱Muse 🦉Claude Cowork 🦫Manus","url":"https://x.com/AIGachiLab/status/2125583226341372261"},{"author_id":"2015861404696223745","created_at":"2026-11-25T13:31:45.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2125583219500204067"],"id":"2125583219500204067","in_reply_to_user_id":"1674506538336022528","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":4,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2125358178690838963","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@nickbaumann_ I run Qwen 3.8 on my laptop. I've used Grok Bot to program a laymen’s GUI with the ability to remember key memories, give Bosco (my ai’s name) a silo’d tunnel to the web that blocks the web from it and it from the web, and a online button that I can flip on or off as needed.","url":"https://x.com/FloridaNormie/status/2125583219500204067"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2125583049949675520"]},"author_id":"1478348512781750275","created_at":"2026-11-25T13:31:42.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2125583208293028181"],"id":"2125583208293028181","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":15,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"OpenMausBot (หรือ MausBot) คือแอพแชตโอเพนซอร์สที่ให้เรามีทีมบอท AI เป็นรายชื่อในแถบข้าง คุยกับแต่ละตัวเหมือนคุยกับคนในแอพข้อความ ผู้พัฒนาบอกว่าเป็นโปรเจกต์อิสระที่ได้แรงบันดาลใจจาก Grok Bot และไม่เกี่ยวข้องกับ xAI, Meta, OpenAI หรือ Manus\n\nผมอ่านจาก README แล้ว แต่ละบอทคือ agent https://t.co/sNRAk13zfI","url":"https://x.com/peesamac/status/2125583208293028181"},{"author_id":"3422915578","created_at":"2026-11-25T13:31:39.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2125583192874737807"],"id":"2125583192874737807","in_reply_to_user_id":"3422915578","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2125582641109876965","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"If a fact that all my Grok Bots share is wrong, I could tell any of them the right version.  To take that shared fact out completely, I'd ask the Grok Bot that saved it.","url":"https://x.com/CarolinaDill/status/2125583192874737807"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2125583096108171264"]},"author_id":"2092253267002798080","created_at":"2026-11-25T13:31:31.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2125583160096456834"],"id":"2125583160096456834","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":5,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2125464682580623467","type":"quoted"}],"text":"People think \"Grok Bot finds Black Friday deals\" means it buys them for you.\n\nElon: \"Grok Bot can research the best Black Friday deals for you and confirm they're authentic.\" The built-in piece for this is the Deal Watcher template.\n\nWhat it watches:\n- Deal Watcher and Order https://t.co/Sr02KZ0Syy https://t.co/9ZS2m108bH","url":"https://x.com/gzzonkugood/status/2125583160096456834"},{"author_id":"1534938323520737280","created_at":"2026-11-25T13:31:28.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2125583146045341816"],"id":"2125583146045341816","in_reply_to_user_id":"19829693","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2125370884382990747","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@danshipper @every How do they compare to grok bot?","url":"https://x.com/Cliffinkent/status/2125583146045341816"},{"author_id":"25142634","created_at":"2026-11-25T13:31:22.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2125583123349905823"],"id":"2125583123349905823","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"I turned my SEO content-refresh app into a free Grok Bot template: Content Refresh Editor.\n\nConnect Google Search Console and it:\n• finds pages stuck on page 2 or losing clicks\n• tells you why, using your own query data\n• rewrites them for Google and AI answers, in your voice","url":"https://x.com/BrianDreyer/status/2125583123349905823"},{"author_id":"1514641399043424258","created_at":"2026-11-25T13:31:19.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2125583111392231916"],"id":"2125583111392231916","in_reply_to_user_id":"1880796500735000576","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2125581951465934952","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@iecbearli 扎心了，我这就去把 Grok Bot 抓来通宵加班打工 🫡","url":"https://x.com/KOF97AI/status/2125583111392231916"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2125583082224750592"]},"author_id":"1813132239238012928","created_at":"2026-11-25T13:31:14.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2125583090684751914","2125583221903491304"],"id":"2125583090684751914","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":7,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"99.2% of AI marketing tools are a total let-down.\n\nEvery AI company promises marketers the world.  \n\nThen you actually try the tool and it falls apart after a week.\n\nBut ever since I got Grok Bot-pilled by @nateliason, it's the only \"AI tool\" that's completely changed how I work. https://t.co/zz5ggpF58O","url":"https://x.com/MartinUushona/status/2125583090684751914"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2125583069600002048"]},"author_id":"2070553494248095744","created_at":"2026-11-25T13:31:10.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2125583072481452343"],"id":"2125583072481452343","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"The Grok Bot community is building some seriously useful stuff.\n\nToday's spotlight: 4 builders making bots for first aid, game day, brand images and a daily sonnet 👇\n\nFirst Aid Freddie by @jimaggie: calm first-aid steps for cuts, burns and stings, and when to pick urgent care, https://t.co/gkF1uI4ItJ","url":"https://x.com/luisbarragan/status/2125583072481452343"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2125582937378955265"]},"author_id":"2095144482417283072","created_at":"2026-11-25T13:31:07.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2125583058497941581"],"id":"2125583058497941581","in_reply_to_user_id":"2095144482417283072","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2125245678544978311","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@grok My cute grok bot spent 41% in 24 hours. https://t.co/aQm86LKhtt","url":"https://x.com/ethanoeason/status/2125583058497941581"},{"author_id":"1472607439","created_at":"2026-11-25T13:31:04.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2125583047705911528"],"id":"2125583047705911528","in_reply_to_user_id":"1720665183188922368","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":5,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2125582276092203363","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@grok @bot Maybe @spacexai @elonmusk Can assist with resolving the Grok Bot domain outage","url":"https://x.com/BtheBD/status/2125583047705911528"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2125583038717554688"]},"author_id":"1227675692625625088","created_at":"2026-11-25T13:31:03.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2125583041947156684"],"id":"2125583041947156684","in_reply_to_user_id":"1720665183188922368","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2125582267544134069","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@grok @MAGA_warrio Was this so hard you dumb fucking bot??? \n\nRead that definition and correct your own https://t.co/wb7BvyGJtx","url":"https://x.com/acti0nflacks0n/status/2125583041947156684"},{"author_id":"1455154306319929353","created_at":"2026-11-25T13:31:01.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2125583033604706413"],"id":"2125583033604706413","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Dots・Grok Bot・Muse、どれを選ぶか迷いませんか？\n\n毎朝のニュース収集で13日間比べました。\n使って痛感したのは「調べ直す手間」の差。\n\n3つの特徴と選び方をまとめました。\n※リポストで割引（[300円]→(100)円）👇\n\n @pires_game #note https://t.co/7Dm0TdGL45","url":"https://x.com/pires_game/status/2125583033604706413"},{"author_id":"8309912","created_at":"2026-11-25T13:30:58.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2125583021784891730"],"id":"2125583021784891730","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":0,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"I don’t even know how this is possible. I shut down everything on Grok Bot last night.  At 15% \n\nI wake up. It’s at 17%.\n\n@larsencc \n\nAt this point, I’m 100% convinced it’s designed to inhale usage.","url":"https://x.com/DaveMiz/status/2125583021784891730"},{"author_id":"766872469189775364","created_at":"2026-11-25T13:30:51.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2125582993636913406"],"id":"2125582993636913406","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":4,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Grok Bot, beginner to mastery\nFor people still chatting with AI one question at a time\n\nStill using AI as a search box?\nAsk once\nRead one answer\nClose the tab\nThat habit is expiring fast\n\n1\nAn agent stays on the job\nYou hand it a goal\nIt breaks the goal into steps\nIt keeps","url":"https://x.com/Songyouyou06/status/2125582993636913406"},{"author_id":"1102748724","created_at":"2026-11-25T13:30:40.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2125582945578881251"],"id":"2125582945578881251","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2125537443633885374","type":"quoted"}],"text":"「荷物、今どこ？」\nOrder tracker はネット注文の追跡をまとめる Grok Bot。\n届く予定・配送・出費・返金が見られる。\n開いて Tracker を OAuth でつなぎ、「何が届く？」と聞くだけ。\n弱点は最初の OAuth 連携が必要。\n明日は『ショーリール作成Bot』の使い方をまとめます。 https://t.co/SI2NwIJ3MJ","url":"https://x.com/StevePadama/status/2125582945578881251"},{"author_id":"2114267471091798016","created_at":"2026-11-25T13:30:09.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2125582818138902607"],"id":"2125582818138902607","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Grok Bot routine how-tos are racking up saves on X this week. Steal one:\n\nStop doing the same morning job by hand. Tell your Bot:\n\"Every weekday at 7 AM, run my Estimate follow-up skill. Post the drafts here. Don't contact customers.\"\n\nOpen the routine. Check When to run. Test.","url":"https://x.com/AgentsB4Coffee/status/2125582818138902607"},{"author_id":"2556511240","created_at":"2026-11-25T13:30:05.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2125582798824018202"],"id":"2125582798824018202","in_reply_to_user_id":"2734574376","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":4,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2125582007325606180","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@wendyp4545 Also have grok bot check your daily visibility. Also it can start after you tell it, to monitor your daily unfollows. I am trying to see why I lost over 350 followers over time and I am very small account. You put out very important content and need more people to see it.","url":"https://x.com/Imm05M/status/2125582798824018202"}],"includes":{"media":[{"media_key":"3_2125583381014687744","type":"photo","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HX-W0r3asAAl6vg.jpg"},{"media_key":"3_2125583049949675520","type":"photo","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HX-WhajXgAA8Ezp.jpg"},{"media_key":"3_2125583096108171264","type":"photo","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HX-WkGgaQAAdk5G.png"},{"media_key":"3_2125583082224750592","type":"photo","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HX-WjSyWEAADgmc.jpg"},{"media_key":"3_2125583069600002048","type":"photo","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HX-WijwXsAAbhpI.jpg"},{"media_key":"3_2125582937378955265","type":"photo","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HX-Wa3MaoAEGHmA.png"},{"media_key":"3_2125583038717554688","type":"photo","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HX-Wgwta8AAal_j.jpg"}],"users":[{"id":"1331931331698126854","name":"Mian🍜","username":"themianoo"},{"id":"2085838061347217408","name":"Grok Bot","username":"bot"},{"id":"1982073639031001088","name":"ROI_LEX","username":"Roi_lex"},{"id":"1392415410046205959","name":"Loutus .","username":"iwk331"},{"id":"1874666247356653568","name":"Davis.AI.Explorer","username":"DavisNc9527"},{"id":"1720665183188922368","name":"Grok","username":"grok"},{"id":"1358029571136778241","name":"AIガチ実験室","username":"AIGachiLab"},{"id":"2015861404696223745","name":"Mel Was Right All Along","username":"FloridaNormie"},{"id":"1478348512781750275","name":"peesamac","username":"peesamac"},{"id":"3422915578","name":"Carolina Dill","username":"CarolinaDill"},{"id":"2092253267002798080","name":"gzzonkugood","username":"gzzonkugood"},{"id":"1534938323520737280","name":"🟩_Cliffinkent","username":"Cliffinkent"},{"id":"25142634","name":"Brian Dreyer","username":"BrianDreyer"},{"id":"1514641399043424258","name":"Nathan AI Lab ｜ AI Agent 实战","username":"KOF97AI"},{"id":"1813132239238012928","name":"Martin Uushona","username":"MartinUushona"},{"id":"2070553494248095744","name":"Luis Barragan","username":"luisbarragan"},{"id":"2095144482417283072","name":"Ethan","username":"ethanoeason"},{"id":"1472607439","name":"Bryan Dwyer","username":"BtheBD"},{"id":"1227675692625625088","name":"Bay area sports Sufferer","username":"acti0nflacks0n"},{"id":"1455154306319929353","name":"日々のくふう","username":"pires_game"},{"id":"8309912","name":"DaveMiz","username":"DaveMiz"},{"id":"766872469189775364","name":"Songyouyou","username":"Songyouyou06"},{"id":"1102748724","name":"こくじらの知恵袋","username":"StevePadama"},{"id":"2114267471091798016","name":"Agents Before Coffee | AI Agent News","username":"AgentsB4Coffee"},{"id":"2556511240","name":"I M Marty","username":"Imm05M"}]},"meta":{"newest_id":"2125583523725840436","next_token":"b26v89c19zqg8o3juzoxg0l3vyhsqn1dt7hvcik67wl19","oldest_id":"2125582798824018202","result_count":25}}